Process

	1. Pods with YAML
		1.1 Yaml structure for a pod
			apiversion: v1
			kind: Pod
			metadata:
			  name: myapp-pod
			  labels:
			    app: my-app
			    type: front-end
			spec:
			  containers:
			    - name: nginx-container
			      image: nginx
		1.2 kubectl create -f pods.yaml
		1.3 kubectl get pods
		1.4 kubectl describe pod myapp-pod
